Chạy với Guest:
npx playwright test tests/register.spec.js -g "Register new account successfully" --project=guest
 
Chạy với login sẵn
npx playwright test tests/login.spec.js -g "Verify the Forgot password link on the Login page" --project=loggedIn
npx playwright test tests/dashboard.spec.js -g "Add a product to the cart and verify it on the Shopping Cart page" --project=loggedIn
 
Chạy hết các TCs
npx playwright test tests/register.spec.js --project=guest
npx playwright test tests/dashboard.spec.js --project=loggedIn